  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amang’ana a Nathani na ogweitia gwa Daudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eri’Omonene agatoma Nathani ase Daudi. Nathani akageenda ase are, akamoteebia, “Abanto babere ’mbaamenyete ase omochie gete, oyomo obo nigo arenge omonda, na oria onde omotaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oria omonda nigo abwate ching’ondi ne chiombe chinyinge mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende oria omotaka tarenge na gento, otatiga abwate akamanwa agasigiti, akwo agorete ng’a atuge. Akamanwa akwo gakaba gakomenya inka amo nabana baye, gakaba gakoria endagera abwate na konywera korwa ase egekombe kiaye. Nigo kaanarete koraara ase egekuba kiaye, gakaba ase are buna omwana oye omoiseke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omogeni agacha bw’omonto oria omonda, na ere tanchete komonyenyera embori gose eng’ondi korwa ase riicho riaye, korende akaira akamanwa karia k’eng’ondi k’omotaka oria, erio agakanyenyera omogeni oye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono Daudi akaberorokwa n’endamwamu enene ase engencho y’omonda oria, agateebia Nathani, “Ekeene, buna Omonene are moyo, omonto oyio okorete amang’ana ayio goika akwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere goika amoiranerie akamanwa karia ara kane, ekiagera akora ring’ana erio, na ekiagera atabwate amaabera.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo Nathani agateebia Daudi, “N’aye omonto oria. Omonene, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, nigo agoteeba iga: Inche nakoagete amaguta okaba omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli, nkagotooria korwa ase okoboko gwa Saulo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakoa abanto bonsi b’omonene oo, nkababeeka abakungu baye ase amaboko ao. Ngakoa n’Abaisraeli amo na Abayuda. Onye ayio namake arenge, nabo naare gokomenta ayande amaange kobua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nase ki gwachaayire ring’ana ri’ane inche Omonene, na gwakorire amabe ase obosio bwane? Gwaitire Uria Omohiti; okamorua, na Abaamoni bakamoita n’omoro, naende kwairire mok’aye koba mok’ao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono omoro tokorua ase ororeria rwao, ekiagera gwanchaayire, kwairire moka Uria akaba mok’ao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee, Omonene oteebire iga: Ningotubokerie obobe korwa ase enyomba yao; nkoure abakungu bao, mbae omonto omoao, nere arare nabarabwo maiso marore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye nigo gwakorire ebibe ebio bobisi, korende inche nigo ndakoe egesusuro ekio maiso marore ase Abaisraeli bonsi barooche.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi agateebia Nathani, “Nakoreire Omonene ebibe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nathani akamoiraneria, “Omonene okwabeire ebibe biao; togokwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ekiagera gwakorire ayio kwagerire ababisa ba Omonene bamochaaye, omwana oria oraiborwe goika akwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Nathani akageenda bwoye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omwana o Daudi ogokwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omonene akarenta oborwaire ase omwana oria moka Uria aiborerete Daudi, na omwana oria akanyareka mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo Daudi agasaba Nyasae ng’a omwana agwene, akeng’ata, akageenda nyomba akaraara inse ase obotuko obogima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na abagaaka b’enyomba yaye bagaacha bamoimokie korwa agwo inse, korende ere tancha, nonya n’endagera, taragerete amo nabarabwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko ria gatano na kabere omwana oria agakwa. Abasomba ba Daudi bakoboa komoteebia ng’a omwana okuure, inaki nigo bateebete, “Ekero omwana arenge moyo, togachia gokwana nere, korende tanchete gotoigwa. Inaki rende toranyare komoteebia ng’a omwana okuure? Nigo arabaise gwekorera bobe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Daudi akarora abasomba baye bakona‐komonyererana, akamanya ng’a omwana okuure. Ase igo Daudi akababooria, “Inee! Omwana nakuure?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bakamoiraneria, “Ee, okuure.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi akaimoka korwa inse agesibia, ageaka amaguta, akaonchoreria chianga chiaye; agasoa ase enyomba y’Omonene agasasiima. Erio akairana bwoye, agasaba endagera, akaegwa akaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasomba baye bakamoteebia, “Ing’ana ki eri gwakora? Ekero omwana arenge moyo okeng’ata na korera korende bono omwana gakuure, kwaimokire kwarageire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabairaneria, “Ee, ekero omwana arenge moyo, nabo neng’atete na korera, nigo narengereretie ng’a ande Omonene nandorere amaabera, erinde omwana abe moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende bono okuure, nase ki rende ’ndeng’ate? Inee! Ninyare komoirania abe moyo? Ninche ndageende aase ageenda, korende ere takoirana ase ’nde.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sulemani Okoiborwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Daudi akaba okoremia Batiseba mok’aye; akaba nere, na ere akaibora omwana omoisia, na Daudi akamoroka Sulemani. Na Omonene akaba bwanchete omwana oria,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "agatoma amang’ana ase Nathani omobani, na ere akaroka omwana oria Yedidia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "ase engencho y’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi Okobua Omochie o Raba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(1 Amg 20:1-3)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabu akarwania Raba bw’Abaamoni, akaira ensemo y’omochie yarenge y’omorwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yoabu agatoma abanto gochia ase Daudi komoteebia, “Narwanirie Raba, nabwatire ensemo y’omochie ase oonchokanire n’amaache.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gaki bono sangereria abanto abwo batigarete oetanane omochie, aye omonyene oyoire, inche timbaisa koyoira na igo orokwe ase erieta riane.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo Daudi agasangereria abanto bonsi, akageenda Raba, akayorwania, akayobua na koyoira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio akarusia eguutwa y’etaabu korwa ase omotwe bw’omorwoti bw’aroro. Oborito bw’eguutwa eria nigo bwarenge koreng’ana chikiiro emerongo etato na inye naende nigo yachabeire amagena ye rigori rinene. Egutwa eyio ekabeekerwa Daudi ase omotwe oye igoro. Ere agasakora ebinto ebinge mono bi’omochie oria:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "agasokia abanto barenge ase omochie ime, akabagabana ase emeremo y’ogochweria nemesumeno, ey’okorema n’echisuururu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "chi’ebioma, ey’okoroisia ebioma, ogwatia n’ebisire, ogotiringa esike na gosaamba amatabori. Naboigo akorerete boigo abanto bonsi b’emechie y’Abaamoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Erio Daudi akairana Yerusalemu amo n’abanto baye bonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
